            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors had first experiences of hip arthrography in prostheses loosening in 1967. Now they explain the results obtained in 51 cases, aknowledging the limits of such a method in a few cases, but generally accepting the value of it for correct therapeutic choices.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
